You've got a sudden idea.
"Doyle, let's make torches! Look, take this reed..."
From what you heard about the dwellers of the Wild Island, you know that they worship fire. So, appearance of men with torches will certainly scare them. And then it will be clear what to do. 
You promptly make a few torches of dry reed. Of course, it won't burn long, but you bet on the moment of surprise. At last, everything is prepared. The heart thumps, but you think it is better to do something, than just sit and wait. Doyle cracks with the lighter, torches instantly ignite. Time to go!